cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Aristarch, please cite this repository AND the upstream Danus and
  Rethlas papers listed under references — the worker-verifier core and the
  fact-graph design are upstream's work.
title: "Aristarch"
repository-code: "https://github.com/yexf308/Aristarch"
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
  # TODO(owner): confirm the author list before tagging a release.
  # Fork commits also carry: Bin Wu, hengyu0510 (Danus side); Haocheng Ju,
  # Shurui Liu, connectedtheorems (Rethlas side). Several of these are ALSO
  # upstream Danus authors — listing them here without asking implies they
  # endorse the rebrand. Ask first.
  - family-names: Ye
    given-names: Felix
    alias: yexf308
references:
